  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "On a peak of San Cha Mountain, Tie Ruo Nan waves her hand and shoots a large cloud of golden needle Gu into a surrounding group of mountain apes.",
        "chapters": [
          374
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_san_cha_mountain",
          "char_tie_ruo_nan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "By itself, golden needle Gu is not wondrous. Matched with poison liquid Gu, it can turn into a poison needle. Matched with stiff Gu, it can leave enemies unable to move a single step. Matched with chaotic mind Gu, it can cause chaos so enemies cannot tell allies from enemies. Matched with vitality Gu, it has healing properties. Tie Ruo Nan spends about seven to eight days becoming proficient in those four battle tactics, then defeats close to a thousand mountain apes alone.",
        "chapters": [
          374
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "matching-other-gu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_stiff_gu",
          "gu_chaotic_mind_gu",
          "gu_vitality_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Tie Mu Bai commands golden needle Gu that are extremely small, like raindrops, and move like a cloud of golden fog that perforates boulders and nearby trees. He also throws three thick, palm-sized golden needle Gu into a mountain ape’s head, unlike the normal finger-sized length.",
        "chapters": [
          374
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "sizes-tie-mu-bai-shows",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "He says golden needle Gu combined with create fog Gu can form golden fog specialized in breaking Gu Master defense, a move he used at twenty-eight around Luchuan river. He says golden needle Gu combined with puppet control Gu can take control of living bodies, and that at rank four peak stage he used that move at Tie Mu mountain against demonic path mountain bandits. Tie Ruo Nan swears that golden needle Gu will not shame his name in her hands.",
        "chapters": [
          374
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "combinations-he-names",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_create_fog_gu",
          "sys_gu_master",
          "loc_luchuan_river",
          "gu_puppet_control_gu",
          "loc_tie_mu_mountain"
        ]
      }
    ]
